OL,5,G0505 Fletchers' Family Farm
OL,6,     FThe Fletchers start making plans
OL,7,     Fto reclaim more of their farmland,
OL,8,     Fwith Kelvin keen to grow oats
OL,9,     Fagain, while Liz wants them to try
OL,10,     Fgrowing maize. All four children
OL,11,     Fget hands-on during lambing, with
OL,12,     Fnine-year-old Marnie bottle
OL,13,     Ffeeding a cade lamb after it is
OL,14,     Frejected by its mother
